# E-4 evidence: `add media "path"` seeds a local file into the device's
# camera roll/gallery via adb push + MEDIA_SCANNER_SCAN_FILE broadcast
# (Android) or `simctl addmedia` (iOS) — CLI-side, no Dart agent RPC.

before each test
  restart the app
  wait until "Quick Add" appears

test "add media seeds a file into the gallery"
  add media "/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-patrickbertsch-dev-flutter-probe/aaed2dc8-a615-49d0-9325-6e308bcf3379/scratchpad/e4_test_photo.jpg"
  wait 1 second
